<h1 class="title libre-caslon font-weight-normal m-35 text-center">Promotional Terms and Conditions</h1>
<h3 class="text-center">How to Make the Most of Your Online Shopping Experience</h3>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-12 mb-5">
<h3>Free Shipping &mdash; Two Ways</h3>

<p><strong>1. When order subtotal is $160&nbsp;or higher: </strong>Offer applies to Standard Shipping to one location in states where we ship ground (no P.O. boxes or states that require expedited air shipping).</p>

<p><strong>2. When shipping is included in the purchase price of bundles (see below):</strong> Offer applies to Standard Shipping to one location in states where we ship ground (no P.O. boxes or states that require expedited air shipping). Shop <a href="/en-US/free-shipping/"><font color="#0000FF">Free Shipping Bundles</font></a> here.</p>


</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-12 mb-5">
<h3>Shipping Rates</h3>
<p>Some Midwestern, Southwestern and Western U.S. states are required to use expedited air shipping due to longer transit times. <a href="/en-US/help/#shipping" title="Shipping Process">See more about our shipping process</a>.</p>
</div></div></div>

<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-12 mb-5">
<h3>$29.99 Value Bundle Prices</h3>
<p>Perdue Farms $29.99 value bundles are limited to one per order and can only be added to a cart that contains a regular-priced product. More than one $29.99 bundle added to a cart will appear at the regular price. Additionally, deeply discounted bundle offers cannot be combined with any other offer or discount. <strong>Note: All Offers Valid While Supplies Last.</strong></p></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-12 mb-5">
<h3>Choose Your Own Bonus Product</h3>
<p>Free Choice of Bonus Product with Purchase: Must have minimum quantity of 1 product in the cart for bonus products to be appear. Only 1 bonus product per order. Bonus product may vary. May not be combined with other offers. Limited quantities are available. While supplies last. First come first served. No rain checks. Not valid on previous purchases.</p></div></div></div>
<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-12 mb-5">
<h3>Free Product with Purchase</h3>
<p>May not be combined with other offers. Limited quantities are available. First come first served and only while supplies last. No rain checks. Not valid on previous purchases. One redemption per customer.</p></div></div></div>
<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-12 mb-5">
<h3>Free Mystery Bonus Product with Purchase</h3>
<p>Must have minimum quantity of 1 product in the cart for mystery bonus product to be applied. Only 1 bonus product per order. Mystery products may vary. May not be combined with other offers. Limited quantities are available. First come first served and only while supplies last. No rain checks. Not valid on previous purchases.&nbsp; Thanksnuggets are not eligible for this promotion.</p></div>
</div>
</div>


<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-12 mb-5">
<h3>Promo Codes</h3>
<p>We want to make it easy for you to sample our selection of premium proteins. Here&rsquo;s how to take advantage of promotions:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Codes cannot be used indefinitely. Be sure to check expiration dates and restrictions before using codes.</li>
	<li>Because they are already so deeply discounted, some product-specific promotions (ex. Introductory Bundles mentioned above) are excluded from further markdown and do not count toward a minimum purchase that may be required by a promo code.</li>
	<li>We limit the number of promo codes that can be used per cost category (individual product, order subtotal and shipping). But you can mix and match codes. For example, an order-level code may be used with a product, brand discount or free gift code. See specific promotions for details.</li>
	<li>At times, we may reserve the right to set minimum and maximum number of products eligible for purchase with a promo code. See specific rules listed with product for details.</li>
	<li>For codes that can be combined, enter one promo code at a time in the box labeled &quot;ENTER PROMO CODE&quot; on the My Cart page and click &quot;SUBMIT.&rdquo; We will alert you when promo codes cannot be combined.</li>
	<li>On occasion, we will offer a one-time-use code via email that must be used solely by the email recipient. In such cases, rules will be included in the disclaimer.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-12 mb-5">
<h3>Sweepstakes and Contest Rules</h3>
<p>From time to time, Perdue Farms may conduct promotions including, but not limited to, contests, giveaways and sweepstakes. Each promotion will have official rules related to eligibility, entry criteria, deadline, prize and more.</p></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-12 mb-5">
<h3>10% Off Newsletter Sign Up</h3>
<p>Users who sign up for our newsletter receive a one-time-only discount of 10% off order subtotal (before shipping and taxes). Promo code will be sent within a few hours in a &ldquo;Welcome to the Family&rdquo; email within a few hours after the user submits his or her email address. This offer cannot be combined with other order subtotal promos. (See rules above.)</p></div></div></div>

<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-12 mb-5">
<h3>Seed Packet 10% Off Code</h3>
<p>Receive 10% off your next online order before shipping at perduefarms.com. Discount will be applied at checkout when the code BEES is entered (must be logged in to the website). This offer has no cash value. Promotional value may be deducted from returns. Not valid on previous purchases or when combined with any other promotional offers. Void where prohibited. The website terms and conditions for this promotion supersede any and all prior terms and conditions printed on in-box seed packets featuring BEES code or otherwise.</p>
</div>
